armon</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Copper status and requirement during the dry period and early lactation in multiparous Holstein cows</article-title><source>J Dairy Sci</source><year>1993</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>2711</fpage><lpage>2716</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8227673</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>